<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CS First Boston starts steel cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CS First Boston starts steel cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it started coverage of 12 steel companies, all with hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Newly rated companies include Lukens Inc, AK Steel Holding Corp, Bethlehem Steel, Allegheny Teledyne Inc, Armco Inc and J&amp;L Specialty Steel Inc.  </p>
<p>-- Other companies are Inland Steel Industries Inc, LTV Corp, National Steel Corp, Rouge Steel Co, USX-U.S. Steel Group and Ryerson Tull Inc.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
